{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">War rocking the universe, it's just beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No more mindless clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new kind of adventure-growth game packed with combat, strategy, and story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Shapeup - Disaster&quot; is a new concept figure world growth game that combines clickers, RPGs, and strategic elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond simple clicks, you can control the flow of battle with pattern analysis, skill build and equipment combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- a simple but deep combat system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thousands of Battle Builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Twelfth Palace Warrior and Stranger Brigade in the Story of the Universe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique buildings such as Square Village, Triangle City, Dimensions, etc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trap, pattern, condition... and endless boss battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 This game does not work with 'Diljiknu'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a battle that requires a real strategy where a momentary mistake leads to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The \ud83d\udd0a background music consists of original songs based on Suno AI,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each battle and scene provides an atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap